.DS_Store
# extension/engine/ is generated by scripts/build-extension.js, and it used to
# be ignored. It is committed now, because "Load unpacked -> extension/" on a
# fresh clone then produced an extension that Chrome showed as enabled, with no
# error anywhere in its UI, which registered no listeners and guarded nothing.
# A committed artifact can drift from src/; test/shipping.test.js fails when it
# does, which is the smaller of the two problems.
